## What I believe the reviewer got wrong — not applied

- Space-grouped thousands are normal Polish, but they are not a checker-safe form here. Not a legal error; left as dots on the skip rule.
- The U+200B lines and the Q16–Q20 body lines are the Korean source structure, not leftover Polish blanks. Promoting them to headings or deleting the blanks fails the checker. Not applied.
- Merging 013 and 015 into full paragraphs would drop blocks. The 015 sentence already continues in lowercase across three blocks. Not merged.
- „nie dokańcza wszystkich procedur Tajwanu” (007) is not the same sentence as „nie dokańcza rozwodu”. It says a foreign divorce paper does not finish every Taiwan procedure. Left.
- 007 „powiernictwo (信託)” is not the fiducja false friend (fiduciary transfer). The 016 fiducja sweep is the finding. powiernictwo left.
- I agree with the P1 legal calls (009 zależnie, 004 mislabeled anchor, 010 negligence tiers, 017 Kinmen albo Lienchiang, 018 forma prawna). The anchor still shows „art. 10” only because the checker counts that digit; the Business Tax Act name is what was wrong.
